{"markup": "<div data-component=\"page\" data-slug=\"roast\" data-name=\"page.roast\" data-v-f08e35e9><div data-component=\"roast\" _type=\"page.roast\" name=\"page.roast\" data-v-f530563a><div data-component=\"transition-logo-mask\" data-v-f530563a data-v-24a16d5c><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" data-v-24a16d5c><defs data-v-24a16d5c><clipPath id=\"v-0-0-0\" clipPathUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" data-v-24a16d5c><path d=\"M0.5 0.459184C0.483235 0.501531 0.483824 0.506633 0.476471 0.540816H0.523529C0.516471 0.505612 0.514706 0.496429 0.5 0.459184Z\" data-v-24a16d5c></path></clipPath></defs></svg><div class=\"slot-wrapper\"  data-v-24a16d5c><header data-component=\"header\" data-v-f530563a data-v-65fed905><div class=\"bg-container\" data-v-65fed905><video type=\"video/mp4\" loop muted playsinline=\"true\" preload=\"auto\" data-component=\"media-asset\" format=\"webp\" quality=\"88\" fetchpriority class=\"media\" data-v-65fed905 data-v-ac455cf8></video></div><div class=\"content-container\" data-v-65fed905><div data-component=\"rive-asset\" class=\"canvas contain icon\" style=\"--ratio:300 / 620;\" data-v-65fed905 data-v-a98c4a7a><canvas data-file=\"/assets/cdn.sanity.io/a835badee51e5121d9a9e1dbe8cb82e9c2bb63dc.riv\" width=\"300\" height=\"620\" data-v-a98c4a7a></canvas></div><h1 class=\"-display-title-2 -uppercase title\" data-v-65fed905>Roast</h1></div></header><main data-v-f530563a><section data-component=\"sub-header\" data-v-f530563a data-v-0429417c><div data-component=\"chapter-text\" style=\"--columns:2;\" data-v-0429417c data-v-5e4e5f48><div class=\"g-row align-center\" data-v-5e4e5f48><div class=\"g-col xxl-12 xl-14  lg-16 md-18 sm-8 xs-12  content-container\" data-v-5e4e5f48><h3 class=\"-mix-text-1-regular title floating-title\" data-v-5e4e5f48>(Roast)</h3><div class=\"content\" data-v-5e4e5f48><p>The green bean is potential. Roasting is revelation. During this process, coffee unveils its form — in body, aroma, and expression. By carefully applying heat, we enhance the unique qualities of each origin.</p><p>At Delta, each roast is tuned with rigour and sensitivity. The variety and the planned destination of each bean guide every decision we make, as even the smallest adjustments in time and temperature can bring forth layers of flavour that only emerge when the process is carried out with complete attention.</p><p>There is science to the process, concentrating on control and consistency. Yet, there is also an art to it — sensing the right moment and having the experience to interpret the behaviour of the grain.</p><p>A good coffee does not undergo change. It reveals itself. The roasting process is where this revelation truly begins.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section data-component=\"steps\" data-v-f530563a data-v-af601d72><div class=\"g-row align-center title-wrapper\" data-v-af601d72><div class=\"g-col xxl-20 sm-8 xs-12\" data-v-af601d72><h2 class=\"-mix-title-4 -text-center title\" data-v-af601d72>Science is in the roasting curve, in the art of time. It is through roasting that coffee gains its voice, and where the sensory profile of Delta coffee is born.</h2></div></div><div class=\"steps-wrapper\" data-v-af601d72><div class=\"inner\" data-v-af601d72><div data-component=\"step-one\" class=\"step\" data-v-af601d72 data-v-06b62871><div class=\"bg-container\" data-v-06b62871><div class=\"upper-title-container\" data-v-06b62871><h3 class=\"-mix-label-1 -uppercase upper-title\" data-v-06b62871>Step I</h3></div><picture data-component=\"media-asset\" autoplay playsinline=\"true\" format=\"webp\" muted class=\"media\" data-v-06b62871 data-v-ac455cf8 data-v-16a76f5b><source media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\" data-v-16a76f5b><source media=\"(min-width: 1291px)\" data-v-16a76f5b><img src=\"/assets/cdn.sanity.io/dfd461d0eaceff8ffb97c8970c3e370121a57546-3400x1960-2b41d8f89a.jpg\" alt=\"Mão em Fundo castanho\" fetchpriority=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-v-16a76f5b></picture><div class=\"subtitles-anchor\" data-v-06b62871><div data-component=\"floating-subtitle\" class=\"is-right floating-subtitle\" data-v-06b62871 data-v-0f277881><div class=\"rotator\" data-v-0f277881><span class=\"line\" data-v-0f277881></span><span class=\"subtitle-wrap\" data-v-0f277881><p class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-0f277881></p><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium subtitle\" data-v-0f277881>Grão Verde</p></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"g-row content-container\" data-v-06b62871><div class=\"g-col xxl-8 xxl-offset-22 md-9 md-offset-23 sm-6 sm-offset-0 xs-10 inner\" data-v-06b62871><h3 class=\"-mix-label-1 -uppercase upper-title\" data-v-06b62871>Step I</h3><h3 class=\"-sans-text-2-medium title\" data-v-06b62871>Grain reading</h3><p class=\"-mix-headline-1-regular description\" data-v-06b62871>Each bean holds potential.\nRoasting starts with understanding what each bean is ready to reveal.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"inner\" data-v-af601d72><div data-component=\"step-two\" class=\"step\" data-v-af601d72 data-v-29e74839><div class=\"bg-container\" data-v-29e74839><div class=\"upper-title-container\" data-v-29e74839><h3 class=\"-mix-label-1 -uppercase upper-title\" data-v-29e74839>Step II</h3></div><picture data-component=\"media-asset\" autoplay playsinline=\"true\" format=\"webp\" muted class=\"media\" data-v-29e74839 data-v-ac455cf8 data-v-16a76f5b><source media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\" data-v-16a76f5b><source media=\"(min-width: 1291px)\" data-v-16a76f5b><img src=\"/assets/cdn.sanity.io/c92691aefad127e036b4f428423a9679f7b1d3c3-3400x1960-2b41d8f89a.jpg\" alt=\"The perfect curve\" fetchpriority=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-v-16a76f5b></picture></div><div class=\"g-row content-container\" data-v-29e74839><div class=\"g-col xxl-8 xxl-offset-22 sm-6 sm-offset-0 xs-10 inner\" data-v-29e74839><h3 class=\"-mix-label-1 -uppercase upper-title\" data-v-29e74839>Step II</h3><h3 class=\"-sans-text-2-medium title\" data-v-29e74839>The perfect curve</h3><p class=\"-mix-headline-1-regular description\" data-v-29e74839>The most delicate moment.\nDelta fine-tunes each batch with science and sensitivity.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"inner\" data-v-af601d72><div data-component=\"step-three\" class=\"step\" data-v-af601d72 data-v-f8ad20bc><div class=\"bg-container\" data-v-f8ad20bc><div class=\"upper-title-container\" data-v-f8ad20bc><h3 class=\"-mix-label-1 -uppercase upper-title\" data-v-f8ad20bc>Step III</h3></div><video type=\"video/mp4\" loop muted playsinline=\"true\" preload=\"auto\" data-component=\"media-asset\" format=\"webp\" quality=\"88\" fetchpriority class=\"media\" data-v-f8ad20bc data-v-ac455cf8></video></div><div class=\"g-row content-container\" data-v-f8ad20bc><div class=\"g-col xxl-8 xxl-offset-22 sm-6 sm-offset-0 xs-10 inner\" data-v-f8ad20bc><h3 class=\"-mix-label-1 -uppercase upper-title\" data-v-f8ad20bc>Step III</h3><h3 class=\"-sans-text-2-medium title\" data-v-f8ad20bc>Profile released</h3><p class=\"-mix-headline-1-regular description\" data-v-f8ad20bc>In a final moment, the body, acidity, and aroma are revealed.\nNotes of chocolate, dried fruits, spices. Everything is defined by and with precision.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-component=\"profile\" data-v-f530563a data-v-3c6a6a10><div class=\"g-row align-center title-container\" data-v-3c6a6a10><div class=\"g-col xxl-20 sm-10 xs-13\" data-v-3c6a6a10><h2 class=\"-mix-title-4 -text-center title\" data-v-3c6a6a10>Each origin calls for a specific roast curve.\nPrecise knowledge, timing, and temperature determine whether the result will be floral and light, or dense and chocolatey.</h2></div></div><div class=\"background-container\" data-v-3c6a6a10><img width=\"3400\" height=\"1634\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Image\" fetchpriority data-v-3c6a6a10 src=\"/assets/images/e998270e2cb4fdbbb04f2955b186e53d3bad285c-3400x1634-8e4b154849.jpg\"><ul class=\"subtitles-list\" data-v-3c6a6a10><li class=\"subtitle-item\" data-v-3c6a6a10><div data-component=\"floating-subtitle\" class=\"is-top floating-subtitle\" data-v-3c6a6a10 data-v-0f277881><div class=\"rotator\" data-v-0f277881><span class=\"line\" data-v-0f277881></span><span class=\"subtitle-wrap\" data-v-0f277881><p class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-0f277881>Light Roast</p><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium subtitle\" data-v-0f277881>The acidity is enhanced, along with notes of floral and fruity aromas.</p></span></div></div></li><li class=\"subtitle-item\" data-v-3c6a6a10><div data-component=\"floating-subtitle\" class=\"is-top floating-subtitle\" data-v-3c6a6a10 data-v-0f277881><div class=\"rotator\" data-v-0f277881><span class=\"line\" data-v-0f277881></span><span class=\"subtitle-wrap\" data-v-0f277881><p class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-0f277881>Medium Roast</p><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium subtitle\" data-v-0f277881>Achieves a balance between sweetness, body, and intensity.</p></span></div></div></li><li class=\"subtitle-item\" data-v-3c6a6a10><div data-component=\"floating-subtitle\" class=\"is-top floating-subtitle\" data-v-3c6a6a10 data-v-0f277881><div class=\"rotator\" data-v-0f277881><span class=\"line\" data-v-0f277881></span><span class=\"subtitle-wrap\" data-v-0f277881><p class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular title\" data-v-0f277881>Dark Roast</p><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium subtitle\" data-v-0f277881>Intensity and persistence, astringency and toasted notes</p></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"list-container\" data-v-3c6a6a10><div class=\"g-row align-center\" data-v-3c6a6a10><div class=\"g-col xxl-32 sm-14 inner\" data-v-3c6a6a10><h3 class=\"-mix-title-3 -text-center profile-title\" data-v-3c6a6a10>From bean to profile</h3><p class=\"-sans-headline-5 -text-center profile-description\" data-v-3c6a6a10>The aromatic expression of coffee</p><div class=\"list\" data-v-3c6