</div></li><li index=\"2\" class=\"item\" data-v-cdc0a632><div data-component=\"info-card\" class=\"vertical\" _key=\"399626a8e239\" _type=\"infoCard\" data-v-cdc0a632 data-v-070f4bf1><div class=\"title-wrap\" data-v-070f4bf1><h3 class=\"-mix-headline-2-regular -text-center title\" data-v-070f4bf1>Dark Roast</h3></div><div class=\"vertical image-container\" data-v-070f4bf1><img width=\"520\" height=\"680\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Image\" fetchpriority data-v-070f4bf1 src=\"/assets/images/960a8334a92ac569632add5f261fa647c3a5611d-520x680-b6b822f6f7.jpg\"></div><div class=\"info-container\" data-v-070f4bf1><div class=\"description\" data-v-070f4bf1><p class=\"-sans-text-3-medium -text-center\" data-v-070f4bf1>Full body, toasted notes, lasting finish</p></div></div></div></li></ul><div class=\"scrollbar-container\" data-v-fc2fe470><div class=\"custom-scrollbar-wrapper\" data-v-fc2fe470><div class=\"custom-scrollbar\" data-v-fc2fe470><div class=\"scroll-thumb\" data-v-fc2fe470></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><h3 class=\"-mix-title-3 -text-center content\" data-v-3c6a6a10>Roasting does not create new flavours.\nIt reveals what nature has already prepared.\n\n</h3></div></div></div></section></main><footer data-component=\"footer\" data-v-f530563a data-v-ec4acc53><div class=\"bg-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><video type=\"video/mp4\" loop muted playsinline=\"true\" preload=\"auto\" data-component=\"media-asset\" format=\"webp\" quality=\"88\" fetchpriority class=\"media\" data-v-ec4acc53 data-v-ac455cf8></video></div><div class=\"scroll-helper-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><span class=\"-sans-text-2-medium label\" data-v-ec4acc53>Keep scrolling for the next chapter</span><span class=\"scroll-helper\" data-v-ec4acc53><span class=\"progress\" data-v-ec4acc53></span></span></div><div class=\"g-row align-center\" data-v-ec4acc53><div class=\"g-col xxl-28 sm-14 center\" data-v-ec4acc53><div class=\"title-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><h2 class=\"-display-title-2 -uppercase title\" data-v-ec4acc53>Blend</h2></div><div class=\"icon-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><div data-component=\"rive-asset\" class=\"canvas contain icon\" style=\"--ratio:300 / 620;\" data-v-ec4acc53 data-v-a98c4a7a><canvas data-file=\"/assets/cdn.sanity.io/0c56fabb3a8d163978170e8d8d318f639539bcc7.riv\" width=\"300\" height=\"620\" data-v-a98c4a7a></canvas></div></div><div class=\"description-container\" data-v-ec4acc53><p class=\"-mix-text-1-regular description\" data-v-ec4acc53>To mix is to create anew. When diverse origins meet in dialogue, complexities and richness emerge. </p></div></div></div></footer></div></div></div></div>", "bodyClass": "page.roast", "title": "Roasting is \nrevelation | Delta Cafés — The coffee of your life", "stylesheet": "/styles/pages/coffee-cycle__roast.css"}